    ('123386c5-0ca7-4674-8b92-e878815ea662'::uuid, 'period_start', '-1200', '-2000', 'fields-wd1-2026-09-26d-s002-rollback:123386c5-0ca7-4674-8b92-e878815ea662:period_start', 'rollback of fields-wd1-2026-09-26d-s002: period_start ''-2000'' restored on Las Cogotas', '[{"source": "https://www.cardenosa.es/ocio-y-turismo/arqueologia/castro-de-las-cogotas.html", "url": "https://www.cardenosa.es/ocio-y-turismo/arqueologia/castro-de-las-cogotas.html", "quote": "Las excavaciones realizadas en el yacimiento han permitido identificar dos periodos de ocupación, uno entre el año 1200 y 800 a.C., coincidiendo con el Bronce Final, denominado Cogotas I", "outcome": "found"}, {"source": "https://www.turismocastillayleon.com/es/patrimonio-cultura/cogotas", "url": "https://www.turismocastillayleon.com/es/patrimonio-cultura/cogotas", "quote": "Las Cogotas es un poblado de entre los siglos VII a. C. y el III d.C.", "outcome": "found"}, {"source": "WD1 decision (counted, round 2, wd1-r2-b0002)", "decision": "replace", "status": "MISSING", "reasoning": "The Cardeñosa town council''s page dates the site''s first, Late Bronze Age (Cogotas I) occupation to 1200-800 BC; the Castilla y León tourism portal dates the settlement from the 7th century BC, and the Museo Abierto de las Sierras de Ávila (not quotable by machine) gives a first occupation in the 13th century BC. All place the start in 1500 - 500 BC; the stored -2000 reflects the formative date of the wider Cogotas I culture rather than this site, so it is replaced with -1200.", "value_page": null}]'::jsonb),
